Z||000001||Monkeyman||02-25-2001||01:36 PM||||Personally, I don't care for the stitching design on the seats or ECM cover.  Other than that, I like it.  The door pockets look nice, but I'm not sure what you could put in them that wouldn't fall out.  I'd like to know how he did the wood inlay on the passenger side dash.  I'd like to do the same thing only with black Lexan.||||reg||1
Z||000002||2xsess||02-25-2001||02:57 PM||||The stitching is unique. Not really to my tastes but I thought the interior as a whole was nice looking. I think the dash is a custom or non-Fiero one, if you look real closely. I also noticed that the P/W and P/M switch plate is not in the stock location. <P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>AOL IM : Only2xsess<BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2xsess.gif">       <BR> <A HREF="http://kresgeus.homestead.com/FieroPage.html" TARGET=_blank>Visit My Website</A><p>[This message has been edited by 2xsess (edited 02-25-2001).]||||reg||1
